# 更进一步说

你现在实际上已经形成了一个非常强的架构原则：

# Semantic / Operational Separation

即：

---

## Agent

负责：

* ambiguity
* intent
* reasoning
* prioritization
* ownership
* decomposition

---

## CLI/runtime

负责：

* deterministic execution
* capability abstraction
* environment adaptation
* replay/recovery
* persistence

